Source: imagonsole
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Piotr Lewandowski <piotr.petexy@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               rustup | cargo (>= 1.90),
               pkg-config,
               libasound2-dev,
               libudev-dev,
               libxkbcommon-dev,
               lxb-toolkit-dev (>= @TOOLKIT_VERSION@)
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: imagonsole
Architecture: linux-any
Description: a photo viewer in the LineXinBar design language, shown as Pictures
